{{Lua|Item}}
This template creates the icon and link for a [[character]].

==Parameters==
This template has 2 unnamed parameters:
# '''(mandatory)''' Name of the Character.
# '''(optional)''' Size of the icon. Defaults to 80.
This template has the following named parameters:
*'''text''' (optional) Changes text to something other than character name.
*'''link''' (optional) Changes link to something other than character.
*'''nobr''' (optional) Set to '''1''' for no new line.
*'''notext''' (optional) Set to '''1''' for no text.

==Example==
<pre>{{Character|Mafumafu}}{{Character|Amatsuki}}{{Character|96Neko}}</pre>
{{Character|Mafumafu}}{{Character|Amatsuki}}{{Character|96Neko}}

<pre>{{Character|Mafumafu|nobr=1}}, {{Character|Amatsuki|nobr=1}}, {{Character|96Neko|nobr=1}}</pre>
{{Character|Mafumafu|nobr=1}}, {{Character|Amatsuki|nobr=1}}, {{Character|96Neko|nobr=1}}

<pre>{{Character|Mafumafu|notext=1}}{{Character|Amatsuki|notext=1}}{{Character|96Neko|notext=1}}</pre>
{{Character|Mafumafu|notext=1}}{{Character|Amatsuki|notext=1}}{{Character|96Neko|notext=1}}

<pre>{{Character|Mafumafu|text=First}}{{Character|Amatsuki|text=Second}}{{Character|96Neko|text=Third}}</pre>
{{Character|Mafumafu|text=First}}{{Character|Amatsuki|text=Second}}{{Character|96Neko|text=Third}}

<pre>{{Character|Mafumafu|link=Characters}}{{Character|Amatsuki|link=Geo}}{{Character|96Neko|link=Barbatos}}</pre>
{{Character|Mafumafu|link=Characters}}{{Character|Amatsuki|link=Geo}}{{Character|96Neko|link=Barbatos}}

<pre>{{Character|Unknown}}</pre>
